        "original_id": "e3cba9c5-994f-5709-8521-b2bd7fdc1cc5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Barry Keoghan, Mark Rylance, Tom Hardy, Cillian Murphy, Kenneth Branagh, Tom Glynn-Carney, Nicole Kidman, Colin Farrell, Alicia Silverstone, Michael Fassbender, Brendan Gleeson\n- Films: Dunkirk, The Killing of a Sacred Deer, Trespass Against Us\n- Events: 2017 Cannes Film Festival, Palme d'Or\n\nFacts:\n- Barry Keoghan was born on 18 October 1992 and is an Irish actor.\n- Barry Keoghan appeared in the film Trespass Against Us with Michael Fassbender and Brendan Gleeson.\n- In 2017, The Killing of a Sacred Deer was selected to compete for the Palme d'Or in the main competition section at the Cannes Film Festival.\n- Barry Keoghan appeared in the film Dunkirk with Mark Rylance, Tom Hardy, Cillian Murphy, Kenneth Branagh, and Tom Glynn-Carney.\n- Barry Keoghan appeared in The Killing of a Sacred Deer with Nicole Kidman, Colin Farrell, and Alicia Silverstone.",
